    "title": "Ember Cup",
    "tagline": "Three circuits, four rivals, one hovering trophy.",
    "heroConcept": "You wear a heat-scarred pit-crew race suit from the neck down: ember-orange shell over charcoal weave, buckle harness, spine coolant lines, mag-grip boots."
